window.products.push({"id":1133018,"name":"YuanKanJu Cupful of Cute The Golden Girls Blanche 16-Ounce Ceramic Mug | Tumbler Cocktail Glasses, Margarita Cup Drinkware For Home Barware Set | Offi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KHdNDsM9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STAY GOLDEN WITH EVERY SIP Well, let's set the scene... have we been drinking? Channel your inner Blanche Devereaux from The Golden Girls with a Cupful Of Cute. This adorable drinkware collection is part of the special artist series by Jerrod Maruyama, celebrating pop culture's biggest icons. Sculpted from top-quality ceramic, the cute character mold is based on Blanche, the man-crazy vixen of the popular '80s sitcom. Channel your inner Southern belle with this 16-ounce figural mug. You can enjoy sipping all your faves, including mai tai, pina colada, and more. THE OFFICIAL CUPFUL OF CUTE COLLECTION Now fans of The Golden Girls can own Blanche, Sophia, Rose, and Dorothy as a \"Cupful of Cute.\" These new character figural mugs (each sold separately) feature the four leading ladies of the hit sitcom, each with a distinct personality. This new artist series by Jerrod Maruyama is sure to look amazing on display and/or for everyday use. Drink to a golden life with this officially licensed Cupful of Cute collection. DRINK UP YOUR FANDOM The sitcom The Golden Girls is an American comedy series featuring the friendship of four older women who share a home in Florida. The show ran for seven seasons and originally aired on NBC from 1985 through 1992. The stars of the show were Beatrice Arthur, Estelle Getty, Rue McClanahan, and Betty White. During its run, The Golden Girls received 2 Emmy Awards and 3 Golden Globe Awards. Each of the four actresses also received an Emmy Award for their performances on the sitcom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KHdNDsM9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRJKSAFDs","source_asin":"B09DSR5Q2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DSR5Q2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DSR5Q2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1133019,"name":"1-2 Year Old Dwarf Washington Navel Orange Tree in Grower's Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DaEZSavJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Washington Navel Oranges give you and abundance of sweet seedless easy to peel fruit that ripen in the early part of the winter until late spring. Washington Navel Trees produce beautiful fragrant flowers and foliage all year round. Washington Navel Oranges are also great for juicing and are nature's sweet treat! About Fruit Production: Due to the blossoming cycles of Citrus & Fruit Trees we cannot guarantee that any of our trees will arrive with developed fruit on them. Since our trees are grown from grafts of mature trees, they do produce fruit years sooner than a seeded tree would. Usually our trees will begin to blossom and produce fruit around two to three years old. The older a tree is, the more likely it is to produce fruit. Fruit production is seriously effected by the care that the tree receives and also the climate that the tree resides in. With proper care, any of our trees will thrive and produce fruit for many years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DaEZSavJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lemon Citrus Tree","source_asin":"B0064CCJLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0064CCJLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0064CCJLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
