window.products.push({"id":1133109,"name":"Sister.ly Drinkware Exquisite Diamond Design Whiskey Decanter Set, Perfect for Storing Bourbon, Cognac, Scotch, Tequila, Vodka, Rum, or Non-alcoholic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zUfHMghFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing Our Exquisite Diamond Design Decanter Set: The Perfect Blend of Elegance and Style Behold, dear drink enthusiasts, the epitome of sophistication and class - our Exquisite Diamond Design Decanter Set! This magnificent ensemble is here to revolutionize your drinking experience and make a statement like no other. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this set is a true masterpiece. Let's dive into its dazzling features and irresistible benefits: Dazzling Diamond Design: Prepare to be mesmerized by the stunning diamond-shaped decanter and matching glasses. The intricate geometric pattern exudes a touch of opulence, instantly elevating your drinking rituals to new heights. Every sip becomes an occasion to celebrate. Superior Craftsmanship: We take pride in delivering nothing but the best, which is why our decanter set is crafted with utmost precision. Made from premium, high-quality glass, each piece boasts impeccable clarity and durability, ensuring long-lasting elegance for years to come. Enhanced Aeration: Unlock the full potential of your favorite spirits with the decanter's exceptional aeration capabilities. As the liquid gently cascades through the diamond-shaped design, it dances with oxygen, releasing rich flavors and heavenly aromas. Your taste buds will rejoice in the symphony of indulgence. Perfect Serving Size: Accompanied by four sleek glasses, this set is designed for sharing moments of delight with your loved ones. The ideal serving size ensures that everyone gets a taste of pure luxury, making gatherings with friends and family even more memorable. Versatile Delights: Whether you prefer fine whiskey, smooth bourbon, or exquisite scotch, our decanter set caters to your refined palate. It effortlessly complements a wide range of spirits, making it the go-to choice for any connoisseur seeking unparalleled elegance. Easy Cleaning: We understand that after an evening of enjoyment, convenience matters. Fear not, for our decanter set is a breeze to clean. The smooth glass surface ensures effortless washing, allowing you to spend more time reveling in the pleasure of your libations. Luxurious Gift: Looking for a truly extraordinary gift? Look no further. Our Exquisite Diamond Design Decanter Set makes a statement as a luxurious and thoughtful present for birthdays, anniversaries, weddings, or any occasion that calls for a touch of indulgence. It's guaranteed to leave a lasting impression. Let our Exquisite Diamond Design Decanter Set take center stage in your drinking rituals. With its captivating design, impeccable craftsmanship, and unrivaled elegance, every sip becomes a moment of sheer indulgence. Elevate your spirits, elevate your style, and embrace the taste of true sophistication. Cheers to unforgettable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zUfHMghFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sister.ly Drinkware HAVE ANOTHER ROUND!","source_asin":"B091PD5164","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091PD5164","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091PD5164","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1133110,"name":"PremierAcCovers - Leaf Guard Summer Open Mesh Air Conditioner Cover - Keeps Out Leaves, Cottonwood and Debris 28x28 - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oJ2OGpi3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Summer/All-season air conditioner covers will keep the bottom of your a/c unit clear of leaves and debris buildup, This cover may be left on while the unit is running. When leaves or debris decay they give off acidic gases that eat at your ac unit's copper tubing, by making small holes that allow freon to escape, causing your compressor to fail........PremierAcCovers extend the life of your unit preventing rusting parts by moisture being trapped inside Our covers are durable and made of tough, synthetic fabric, pvc-coated polyester breathable 1/4 inch mesh, We offer a Full 5 year manufacturer's warranty...100% satisfaction guaranteed or you money back including shipping within 30 days.....Each purchase, contains directions for quick and easy installation, no tools needed.......... Four nylon long lasting bungee cords are included…. Made in the U.S.A. with American made materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oJ2OGpi3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PremierAcCovers","source_asin":"B007EDKIR6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007EDKIR6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007EDKIR6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1133111,"name":"Boston International, Cocktail Napkins Reindeer Pattern, 20 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a-Id5MaML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Rosanne Beck Collections combines innovative concepts with fresh Color palettes, bringing classic and whimsical together in a playfully sophisticated signature style. Create dynamic tablescapes and stunning place settings by pairing patterned napkins with matching plates and coordinating solids. Plates and napkins are offered in multiple sizes, allowing you to mix and match, layer and customize. Ideal Home Range offers a sustainable option for conscientious consumers, producing 100% biodegradable napkins using the safest tissues, inks and printing processes. Ihr napkin tissue is 100% cellulose from cracked wood (fallen trees) and plantation wood (managed forests where trees are planted specifically for the production of paper materials) and all tissue is oxygen bleached without the use of chlorine. Ihr ink is water soluble, contains no heavy metals or solvents of any kind and meets the requirements of German food and health laws and the USFDA. Used ink is never dumped into sewage and is always recycled and reintegrated into the Color system. The production working area is naturally pollution-free and no harmful emissions are produced. Ihr has earned a certificate of approval from the forest Stewardship Council (FSC), a prestigious certificate only awarded to those who meet all of the FSC's standards for sustainability, forest management, well being of the forest workers and effects on indigenous peoples and the local environment. Ideal Home Range is exclusively represented in the United States by Boston International and is considered to be the International market leader and trendsetter in the field of high-class table decoration and interior accessories. Ihr began in an old village school in Germany in 1977, when Ingrid and Hanjo Rick conceived the idea of producing accessories in the arts and crafts tradition in order to communicate their concept of interior design. More than 8, 000 items are offered today in most countries of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a-Id5MaML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B0775NTHQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0775NTHQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0775NTHQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
