window.products.push({"id":1133193,"name":"Bonnecaze French Bistro Table 24\", White Marble","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AuNm1IPUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finally, affordable marble bistro tables are now available in the United States. Originally made popular during Paris' Belle Époque, marble bistro tables such as these, continue to be used in restaurants and bistros throughout France and other parts of Europe. These solid marble top and cast iron base tables are constructed in the same manner as they were over 100 years ago. Each table features an antiqued, seamless brass band which encompasses the rim of the marble. The cast iron, three legged base features the same detail taken from an original early 20th century French bistro table. All construction has been faithfully reproduced, including the way the marble is a fixed to the table. It features 3 heavy duty steel prongs used under the table top to hold the marble to the base. The cast iron base and stem are held together by a large screw underneath the base. The tables are suitable for use indoors or out. If used outside, tarnishing may occur to the brass band.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AuNm1IPUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonnecaze","source_asin":"B071SKBLG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071SKBLG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071SKBLG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
