window.products.push({"id":1133216,"name":"Deluxe Comfort Microsuede Throw Pillows, 16\" by 16\", Purple 2 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71imisHMXCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's been a long and tiring day, and at long last you retreat to the privacy of your abode. The moment you open the door, you relish the sight of two of the main reasons that you are more than pleased to be home! The Microsuede Deco Feather and Down-Filled Pillows from Deluxe Comfort is the cushy and collective key to beautiful and functional home fashion. With their sublime feather and down-filling and smooth microsuede casing, these lush and generously-sized contemporary pillows will cushion and comfort you, making it feel as though you are resting or sleeping on a cloud. Like a soft velvet throw pillow, this whisper-soft pillow will ease your aches and pains as you lounge atop its succulent surface. This versatile wedge ramp combo also shines in its amazing flexibility. These could serve in the role of bed pillows for sitting up, a reading pillow wedge, a bed lounger with arms, a TV pillow with arms, floor pillows with arms, a support pillow for bed, sitting pillows for a seat or couch or a microsuede couch pillow. This triangle pillow wedge even could serve as a pillow, doubling as massage furniture, a healthy back bed wedge, a breastfeeding wedge or a pregnancy bed rest when needed. Beauty is another prominent feature of this haute couture throw pillow set, which comes in a myriad of eye-catching and lustrous colors. If your home decor scheme requires the placement of a taupe pillow, a microsuede black pillow, or a purple grape, red, chocolate brown or peridot pillow, then this is the couch pillow set for you! These bright and glamorous furniture pillows are sure to add beauty and color to any room, impressing guests and family members alike! Deluxe Comfort's Microsuede Deco Feather and Down-Filled Pillows is a work of art turned functional and comfortable...a must-have for your home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71imisHMXCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deluxe Comfort","source_asin":"B087CLSTN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087CLSTN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087CLSTN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
