window.products.push({"id":1133449,"name":"Fun Express Gold Shamrock Felt Derby Hat for St. Patrick's Day","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hMW2pO9FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sham-rock this when it comes time to party like a lucky leprechaun! A must-have for St. Patrick's Day party favors or photo booth props, this derby hat comes in a vivid green color and features a shimmering gold shamrock print. Whether your plans include hopping from bar to bar with your pals or beating a little red-headed dude to the end of a rainbow to snatch his pot of gold, this hat will make sure this is one St. Patty's Day you soon won't forget! Felt. 23\" circ.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hMW2pO9FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fun Express","source_asin":"B07Q3Y8PBP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q3Y8PBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q3Y8PBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1133450,"name":"Laura Ashley 5x7 Gold Mirror Bead Picture Frame, Classic Mirrored Frame with Beaded Border, Wall-Mountable, Made for Tabletop Display, Photo Gallery a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Va5S9tqkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Laura Ashley mirror bead frame is a charming accent to any interior space that will do more than just display your favorite photos. The understated elegance to these frames is strikingly evident in its design. The mirrored finish to this attractive frame reflects light, providing a welcome illumination to the inviting atmosphere you want to cozy up in. The feeling created by seeing your memories displayed in stunning and classic style may fill you with a sense of warmth. The shimmering, slanted mirror is surrounded with a beaded border on its outer and inner edges, creating the “pop out” effect that draws the eye to the beauty in your portrait shots. The distressed metallic look of the studded borders gives off a vintage allure that will make the history in black-and-white photos seem to come alive. When viewed from a shelf on a side angle, the brushed, metallic look of the edges recalls a sense of timeless familiarity. This gorgeous frame has a surprisingly sturdy feel to it that stands out when you hold it, helping the moment or memory preserved inside it attract attention. Rest this frame vertically or horizontally on any desk or shelf and enjoy the delightful touch of style it adds to any space. It has a rich black velvet back with a firm 2-way easel to match. Hanging tabs are attached, allowing it to be beautifully mounted on a wall either vertically or horizontally. Decorating your blank walls with these chic frames can turn your living room or office into your own personal art gallery. A series of cityscape photos displayed on a wall may breathe new life into your living space. Share the joy these decorative frames bring you with your friends, family, and co-workers, as they make a thoughtful gift for the holidays or any season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Va5S9tqkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B082YFC87N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082YFC87N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082YFC87N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
