window.products.push({"id":1133511,"name":"WARDFYT Pour Spout Cover Replacement Compatible with Ninja Blender Lid 72 oz Pitchers,Replacement Lid Flap Spout Cover for Nin-ja Blender Square Pitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xF-otzgoL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"【ATTENTIONS】- 1). ONLY POUR SPOUT COVER FOR NINJA IS IN THE PACKAGE. Please NOTE that the entire blender lid is NOT included. The square pitcher top shown in the picture is only for your reference; 2). Please see the applicable ninja blender lid shown in the image NO.2&NO.3 CAREFULLY before buying in case of yours doesn’t match; 3). We don’t claim this replacement ninja spout lid is the original. 【COMPATIBILITY】- The lid flap replacement for ninja only fits for OLDER square lid of ninja blender 72 oz pitchers. Please check the images of the applicable lid carefully. The compatible ninja blender models include BL550, BL500C, BL500, BL610, BL642, BL660, BL660C, BL700WM, BL700RC, BL700C, BL700, BL740, BL770, BL771, BL780, BL780CO, NC600CCO, NJ600, NJ602, NJ600C, NJ600RC, NJ602CO, NJ602NQ, NJ602Q, NJ602W and more. 【QUALITY MATERIAL】- Our lid spout cover for ninja blender adopts the same material as the original - Clear Polycarbonate, which has high impact strength and heat resistance. So, compared with other cheap plastic ninja spout covers that are Hand-Wash only , ours is Dishwasher Safe to free your hands. 【SAVING MONEY】- This pour spout lid for ninja has the same appearance, material and performance as the original. It will make your ninja blender lid like new after being installed. Thus, you don’t need to spend much money to buy a new entire lid or even more expensive blender. 【EASY INSTALLATION】- The pour spout flap replacement for ninja blender only requires a little effort to snap in place. Just put one of the pins into the lid, then carefully \"slid\" the other side's pin into place. It will fit securely once everything is done. More details, you can refer to our video uploaded. If the flapper breaks off during installation, you can message us for free replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xF-otzgoL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WARDFYT","source_asin":"B0BZH6MZKX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZH6MZKX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZH6MZKX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
