window.products.push({"id":1133611,"name":"Generic, 5-Pc Stack-Saver Mini Ceramic Cookware Set - Avocado Oil Infused Ceramic Coating wHeat-Resistant Rubber Grip Handles. Great for Camping and P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MUxVOaSZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bigger isn't always better and this 5-piece Cookware set proves it! The Perfect Cookware Set! Perfect for single people, people with small kitchen space or anyone wanting to practice portion control this set has everything you need to cook food and more. Make a couple of eggs, one hamburger, a can of soup, grilled cheese and more. It's easy to make a Panini too. No more lugging out a machine just use the flat pan for perfect Panini's! Safe and Healthy Cooking The avocado oil infused ceramic coating ensures non-stick cooking so you can use little or no oil for a healthy option. What is even better is aside from cast-iron, ceramic is the safest surface to cook on! It is completely Teflon, PTFE and PFOA free and you still non stick! This set saves 30 Percent more space because of the nesting (stackable) properties of the pots and pans. Plus the size of these ensure you'll cook the right amount every time. Best Ceramic Cooking Set - Mini Category From the ceramic coating which is one of the safest and most durable surfaces to cook on, to the fact that it is avocado infused makes this the set to own! While this is great for any home it is perfect for singles, college students, or anyone with minimal kitchen space. What's Included: - 6 Inch Mini Pan - 6 Inch Mini Square Pan - 0.7 Qt Sauce Pan With Lid - 6 Inch Mini Wok Pan FEATURES and BENEFITS: - 5 pc Set - Great for Portion Control - Great for Single People - Ceramic Coating - Healthy, Safe and Non Toxic: PTFE/PFOA, Chemical Free - Ultra Non-Stick Avocado Coating - Healthy Cooking: Use Little or No Oil - Space Saving: Easy Storage and Stacking - Works on Gas, Electric or Ceramic Glass Stove-Tops - Heat-Resistant Rubber Grip Handles - Aluminum Composition Ensures Even Heat Distribution All Around","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MUxVOaSZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B094LLJX6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094LLJX6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094LLJX6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
