window.products.push({"id":1133677,"name":"Iittala Atlas 110mm Candleholder, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EkuVyVYZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Illuminate a room with the flicker of candlelight from this unique 9-inch black Atlas candleholder from the renowned Scandinavian design group Iittala. Created by innovative and award-winning Finnish designer Harri Koskinen, the Atlas candleholder first hit the scene in 1996 and returns to Iittala’s artisan home décor catalog due to popular demand. The candleholder’s hollow conical stem becomes narrower as it extends up from its base to the candleholder’s elliptical-shaped top. Without a taper candle inserted in the designated slot, the candleholder almost resembles a tall, sleek mushroom, but with a decidedly urban twist. The Atlas candleholder benefits from lead-free glass construction, carefully blown and molded by glass artisans in Finland. The heavy weight of the candleholder provides extra stability. For safe use, never leave candles burning unattended and extinguish the candle with at least 1/3-inch of the wick remaining to protect the candleholder from unnecessary duress. Wash the candleholder by hand with a mild detergent and avoid abrasive scrubbers to remove dried drops of wax. In addition to black, the Atlas candleholder is also available in clear, white, and fiery red glass. A manufacturer warranty covers any defects in the candleholder’s construction. The candleholder measures 4-1/5 by 4-1/5 by 9 inches high and weighs 2 pounds upon shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EkuVyVYZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iittala","source_asin":"B001RIY24O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001RIY24O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001RIY24O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
