window.products.push({"id":1133727,"name":"Easy Tuck (tm) Deep Plush Microfiber Blanket (Taupe, Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+cJVjDbqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why didn't they think of this before??? Cut your bed making time and effort in half! The Easy Tuck innovation is best described as a \"fitted\" self-centering blanket. Finally, the functional elastic pockets of a fitted sheet are fused together with the draping properties of an oversized blanket. Here's how the patented design works: Step 1 :Once your sheets are made up on the bed, the blanket's proprietary \"elastic pockets\" are tucked in at the bottom left and right corners. Step 2 :Pull it up to the top. Step 3 :Smooth your blanket, and you're done! The sides drape and fall evenly on both sides, creating a custom fit. This patented design eliminates the pain-inducing process of lifting a mattress to get a secure, fitted bed. Easy Tuck Bedding saves time and effort, changing what was once a chore into a quick 1-2-3 process! Easy Tuck is also great for active sleepers by keeping your blanket centered and tucked under the bottom end of your mattress. No more messy beds! Knitted of the highest quality deep plush microfiber, these 250 gram blankets are beautifully appointed and sewn to give you the softest, most luxurious sleep experience. The pockets on the patented fitted blanket should accommodate a deep mattress and pillow top up to 19 Inches: measure before you purchase for best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+cJVjDbqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Easy Tuck","source_asin":"B00KGHQHY0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133727","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KGHQHY0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KGHQHY0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
