window.products.push({"id":1133952,"name":"Zulay Kitchen Bamboo Knife Drawer Organizer Insert - Edge-Protecting Knife Organizer Block Holds Up To 11 Knives - Smooth Finish Drawer Knife Organize","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GClFBSrUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Space-saving Design Fits in Most Drawers: The Zulay Kitchen Bamboo Knife Block is an ingenious and space-saving knife storage tool that is designed to keep your counter space free and increases the overall capacity of your in-drawer shelf. It’s 17 inches long, 5.4 inches wide and 2 inches tall dimension is thoughtfully engineered to fit right inside all standard kitchen drawers. Note: Knives NOT included. Premium Quality Material That is Made to Last: Made of premium quality bamboo, has a 2-inch depth streamline design that can fit up to 11 knives of varying sizes including steak, utility, bread, santoku, and paring knives. Its ⅛ inches slot width is engineered to accommodate knives with large or curved blades and handles. Innovative & Functional Design: Well-made and nicely-finished knife organizer that has a smooth rounded edge that will surely make your drawers look beautiful, attractive, and neatly organized. Its innovative design is made to prevent knives from jamming or cluttering up your drawer. The knives are easy to remove and can insert efficiently into their individual slots which makes them very accessible. Perfect Solution to Your Knife Storage Needs: You can now efficiently organize your knives by storing them right inside your drawer. This knife block is a better alternative to your clunky countertop knife holder that is left in plain sight. Its water-resistant surface can be cleaned easily by simply wiping down with a damp cloth then rubbing it with some olive oil to extend its glossy exterior finish. No Hassle, Zulay Guarantee: We love and take pride in our Bamboo Knife Block and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. Have the confidence that this product will last, if there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed. If it does not, we got you covered. Chances are, you will never need to reach out!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GClFBSrUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B085QMX4BS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1133952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085QMX4BS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085QMX4BS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
